Microsoft components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Feature Heist contains no Microsoft files. On the target machine it extracts
components from Windows Server installation media provided by the user and
installs them on Windows 11. Those components remain Microsoft software under
Microsoft's license terms; using Windows Server components on a Windows client
is not covered by the Windows client license. Feature Heist is not affiliated
with or endorsed by Microsoft. Windows and Windows Server are trademarks of the
Microsoft group of companies.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

None. The scripts use only components that ship with Windows (PowerShell 5.1,
DISM, netcfg, sc, the Windows catalog API).
